    <h1>Why Your 2&nbsp;PM Coffee Gives&nbsp;You<br class="d"> <em>More Edge Than Energy</em></h1>
    <p class="dek">I kept treating the afternoon crash with another cup until I found a plant from the coffee family that works in a completely different lane.</p>
    <div class="byline">
      <img class="byline__photo" src="{{ 'adv-coffee-author-thomas.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Thomas Hardwick" width="600" height="600">
      <div><div class="byline__who">By Thomas Hardwick</div><div class="byline__meta">For The Dandy Daily · 6 minute read</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figure>
    <!--HERO-->
    <img src="{{ 'adv-coffee-hero-afternoon-man.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A man at a home office desk in the afternoon, one hand around a coffee mug, staring at an unfinished email on his laptop" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high">
